      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: would be great to have our own personal designed UI controlled over an OSC API. I see a lot of potential here too. If you need any other usecase inspiration:\n\n* First time onboarding or remote assisted VRChat. i could help a friend Or a community could help new ppl in VRC with there settings.\n\n* shortcuts in expression menu or when touching your avatar\n\n* HMD setting presets if you using different settings for your HMDs for like FOV, colors, brightness.\n\n* \"Streamer Settings\" When OBS starts it could turn on my Personal Space and streamer mode and disable untrusted URLs, maybe even content filtering\n\n* Adjusting your menu colors based on your avatar colors (or vice versa)\n\n* (reproducable) Debugging, maybe we can even use this for atuomated testing of worlds or avatars\n\n* Color/Brightness adjust depending on daytime\n\n* FPS Limit when not in focus for x minutes\n\n* many more QOL improvements like turning Nameplates hidden when in bigger instances\n\nI could even think as far as the community could work on so many things we are not aware of. What about an automatic Earmuff distance mode? or audio nomilization for events?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
