  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like to change (VRC) settings over OSC for advanced OSC apps. Ex. as a photo-/videograph i would like to always ensure to turn off my Near field camera and turn my emissions to 100%. Voices to 0%.\n\nIn between i might like to use my camera (https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/expose-vrc-camera-to-osc) or like to make use of other settings to create different effects for the camera.\n\nAfterwards i would to go back to 0% Emissions and 50% Voices. \n\nAnother example would be in an OSC app which scales you. As \"blowup\" gimick for twitch. Or to scale you in relation of another avatar.",
